# Fedora-family base repos do NOT carry obs-studio (rpmfusion-only), so the
# rpm family intentionally declares NO native obs package here. The runner
# renders no system batch on rpm; OBS comes via the flatpak alternative
# (com.obsproject.Studio -- the real Flathub id, verified HTTP 200; the
# org.* spelling is 404) or by enabling rpmfusion (out of this module's
# remit -- see P7.5 for repo-add). This comment-only list file is the
# documentation surface for that decision (the P4.2 family gate is already
# satisfied by flatpaks.list alone).